###############################################################################

# - Adsorption-energy agreement is given only approximately in the text (about 0.1 eV vs non-spin-polarised RPBE and about 1.2 eV vs spin-polarised RPBE for UMA-OC20; about 0.3 eV relaxed and 0.2 eV single-point for UMA-OMat24); per-adsorbate values are in SI Tables S1-S7. Geometry norms are structural comparisons.
